      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_73f22a3afb1714a42fe4cbf0f42d77d37ccb9fdfccd9dfb721a43d86db9f3532"
      ],
      "text": "The app is Electron with three contexts: src/main as the shell, src/preload as the sole bridge exposing window.nodeTerminal, and src/renderer as React UI, with src/shared holding types and IPC channel names used by all three."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_087676e90631b7f7e584a10785e506fad53963e64aa14b73af9c0f67d5c57a76",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37",
          "git_sha": "943db5b431b1a9c661ae0a5d4286f22db403a1a4",
          "line_end": 311,
          "line_start": 297,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "eneskirca/nodeterm",
          "url": "https://github.com/eneskirca/nodeterm/blob/8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37/README.md#L297-L311"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_73f22a3afb1714a42fe4cbf0f42d77d37ccb9fdfccd9dfb721a43d86db9f3532"
      ],
      "text": "Services (PTY, workspace/settings, git, agents, hooks) live in src/core behind a CorePlatform interface and never import Electron; the browser Server Edition boots the same services over a WebSocket-RPC bridge."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7cff94270b1ed89720011b86265ae6f6a75efd57da92e5e0cf326e1e7ec5b742",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37",
          "git_sha": "943db5b431b1a9c661ae0a5d4286f22db403a1a4",
          "line_end": 311,
          "line_start": 297,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "eneskirca/nodeterm",
          "url": "https://github.com/eneskirca/nodeterm/blob/8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37/README.md#L297-L311"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_73f22a3afb1714a42fe4cbf0f42d77d37ccb9fdfccd9dfb721a43d86db9f3532"
      ],
      "text": "The renderer depends only on a TerminalTransport abstraction: LocalTransport talks to the local host and RemoteTransport to a remote agent over SSH, so remote projects drop in without canvas UI changes."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7e02a8c44ce62f8ec6d42e2c852f68e49a5e16fb11272a16e82e0dfefaaf78a8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
