          "url": "https://github.com/eneskirca/nodeterm/blob/8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md#L8-L25"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_52dcf72fa7416cf6f021f232c0250143b68eb9e0c24ce446b2fcfac45f5ed67c"
      ],
      "text": "Bundled components include Electron, React, React Flow, xterm, Monaco, node-pty, zustand, electron-updater/builder, ws, and tweetnacl, plus tmux/libevent/utf8proc in macOS builds; the Anthropic agent SDK is proprietary."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_25333948595f7f979f919cdc767158311e7056a49176ff63f6d0982ab59dfa91",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37",
          "git_sha": "943db5b431b1a9c661ae0a5d4286f22db403a1a4",
          "line_end": 226,
          "line_start": 207,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "eneskirca/nodeterm",
          "url": "https://github.com/eneskirca/nodeterm/blob/8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37/README.md#L207-L226"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e2f5c043a86f52ba3d747fce5a5fc9c74597acfaeaf59ce8125096bafe3d1d7b"
      ],
      "text": "Windows support is beta: the installer is unsigned, updates are manual, and restart-to-restart session continuity is still landing because Windows lacks tmux; a standalone session host replacing it is being packaged."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_661d393fc66356c62e7d5a27ac9c1a6eabb725268487c261bcd2b6db718c25ec",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37",
          "git_sha": "943db5b431b1a9c661ae0a5d4286f22db403a1a4",
          "line_end": 168,
          "line_start": 165,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "eneskirca/nodeterm",
          "url": "https://github.com/eneskirca/nodeterm/blob/8fd38d2c229e2ba1f18822df30c48afdefe83e37/README.md#L165-L168"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_02c66914095aca507c6db0d667231ba866ccdac098ec941cb0752462f25a5fec"
      ],
      "text": "The Server Edition runs headless on a Linux or macOS host, accessed from any browser with single-user password auth, a WebSocket bridge, and the same renderer as the desktop app."
    },
